  "summary": "MultiFactor Authentication for SilverStripe can bypass MFA during password reset flow",
  "details": "### Impact\nIn CMS 5, the password reset flow let a user with multi-factor authentication enabled change their password and get a logged-in session before completing multi-factor authentication. Exploiting this requires access to the user's email account. CMS 6 is not affected.",
